OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy with plenty of clear spells
OL,7,Fleading to the likelihood of
OL,8,Fwidespread mist and fog developing
OL,9,Fovernight, particularly through
OL,10,FLincolnshire. Light winds.
OL,11,FTemperatures around average for the
OL,12,Ftime of year, but chilly in clearer
OL,13,Fareas.
OL,14,
OL,15,CFriday:FOvernight mist and fog clears
OL,16,Fslowly through the morning to give a
OL,17,Freasonable afternoon with sunny
OL,18,Fspells. Fog likely to return
OL,19,Fovernight. Light winds. Mild by day,
OL,20,Fchilly overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
