OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FDamp
OL,6,Fand cloudy day on Saturday with mist
OL,7,Fand fog lingering. Cloudy with light
OL,8,Frain overnight on Sunday. Dry and
OL,9,Fpartly cloudy into Monday. Light
OL,10,Fwinds. Temperatures near normal.
